  "description": "Captain Roan is assigned a top-secret mission by his superiors. The core of the mission is to track down a specific individual, X. While scouring his intelligence network, Roan uncovers an unexpected lead. It turns out that the mercenary Max has a direct connection to X. Without hesitation, Roan contacts Max, who offers a commensurate reward and tells Roan, “Open yourself up until I’m satisfied.” With no other options, Roan accepts the terms, but...\n\n(Source: Ridibooks, translated)",
